.TH AWS-LC-C_REHASH 1 "November 2026" "aws-lc 5.12.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aws-lc-c_rehash \- create symbolic links to certificates by subject hash
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aws-lc-c_rehash
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ directory ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aws-lc-c_rehash
runs
.B aws-lc-openssl rehash
with its arguments, which scans directories for certificates and CRLs and
creates the hash-named symbolic links that OpenSSL-style certificate lookup
expects. The script prints a trace of its commands on standard error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aws-lc-openssl (1),
.BR c_rehash (1)
